// The parse-stage vocabularies: a misspelled statement verb and a misspelled
// declaration-block clause head. Both were unreachable from a suggestion until
// the match arms they dispatch on were mirrored into tables — a name a program
// may WRITE has to be a name a diagnostic can SUGGEST.
workflow MisspelledKeyword

output result Done

class Done {
  note string
}

rule finish
  when started
=> {
  recrod Done { note "ok" }
}
